<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>GapFinder | Coordinator Workspace</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@700;900&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        body { background-color: #f8f9fa; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: hidden; }
        a { text-decoration: none; }
        .navbar-custom { background: white; padding: 20px 5%; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.03); position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 1000; }
        .brand { font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-size: 1.6rem; color: #162622; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
        .brand span { color: #00aeef; }
        .nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px; }
        .nav-separator { border-left: 1px solid #eee; height: 20px; margin: 0 5px; }
        .nav-links a, .nav-links span { color: #555; font-weight: 500; transition: color 0.3s; }
        .nav-links a:hover { color: #00aeef; }
        .btn-outline { border: 2px solid #00aeef; color: #00aeef !important; padding: 6px 15px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; transition: 0.3s; font-size: 0.9rem;}
        .btn-outline:hover { background: rgba(0, 174, 239, 0.1); }
        
        .dashboard-container { margin-top: 50px; margin-bottom: 60px; }
        .gf-card { background: white; border-radius: 15px; padding: 30px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border: 1px solid #f0f2f5; height: 100%; border-top: 4px solid #00aeef; }
        .gf-card h5 { font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; color: #162622; font-weight: 700; border-bottom: 2px solid #f0f2f5; padding-bottom: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px;}
        
        .stat-box { background: #f1f8ff; border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 174, 239, 0.1); }
        .stat-box h3 { color: #00aeef; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 5px; font-size: 2.2rem; }
        .stat-box p { margin: 0; color: #555; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; }
        
        .list-group-item { border: none; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding: 15px 0; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        .list-group-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        
        .action-btn { background: #00aeef; color: white; border: none; padding: 8px 15px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; transition: 0.2s; }
        .action-btn:hover { background: #0095cc; color: white; transform: translateY(-1px); }
        .hover-shadow:hover { box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border-color: #dee2e6 !important; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Unified Navigation Bar -->
    <nav class="navbar-custom">
        <a href="/coordinator" class="brand">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap" style="color: #00aeef;"></i>
            Gap<span>Finder</span>
        </a>
        <div class="nav-links d-none d-md-flex">
            <!-- Ensure dynamic username rendering if available -->
            <span class="text-muted me-3">Welcome, <strong>Coordinator</strong></span>
            
            <!-- Direct link to the newly secured Security Center -->
            <a href="/profile/security"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved me-1 text-success"></i> Security Center</a>
            <div class="nav-separator"></div>
            
            <!-- Secure Logout -->
            <a href="/auth/logout" class="btn-outline"><i class="fa-solid fa-right-from-bracket me-1"></i> Logout</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="container dashboard-container">
        <!-- Header Section -->
        <div class="mb-4">
            <h4 style="font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; color: #162622;">Coordinator Workspace</h4>
            <p class="text-muted mb-0">Manage tutoring assignments, monitor mathematics competency tracking, and review MATATAG curriculum alignment.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-4 mb-4">
            <!-- Stats Row -->
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="gf-card">
                    <h5><i class="fa-solid fa-chalkboard-user text-primary me-2"></i> Active Tutors</h5>
                    <div class="stat-box mt-3">
                        <h3>14</h3>
                        <p>Currently Assigned</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="gf-card border-top border-success">
                    <h5><i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired text-success me-2"></i> Competency Models</h5>
                    <div class="stat-box mt-3" style="background: #f0fdf4; border-color: rgba(25, 135, 84, 0.1);">
                        <h3 style="color: #198754;">42</h3>
                        <p>Active Bayesian Networks</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="gf-card border-top border-warning">
                    <h5><i class="fa-solid fa-book-open text-warning me-2"></i> Curriculum Alignment</h5>
                    <div class="stat-box mt-3" style="background: #fffcf0; border-color: rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.1);">
                        <h3 style="color: #ffc107;">100%</h3>
                        <p>MATATAG Compliant</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-4">
            <!-- Left Column: Team Activity Feed -->
            <div class="col-md-7">
                <div class="gf-card">
                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center border-bottom pb-3 mb-3">
                        <h5 class="mb-0 border-0 pb-0"><i class="fa-solid fa-clipboard-list me-2"></i> Recent Team Activity</h5>
                        <button class="action-btn">View All</button>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="list-group mt-3">
                        <div class="list-group-item">
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
                                <div style="background: #e9ecef; width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
                                    <span class="fw-bold text-secondary">RG</span>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <h6 class="mb-0 fw-bold">Rienzel Galang</h6>
                                    <small class="text-muted">Updated algebra competency model for Student #1042</small>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <span class="badge bg-light text-dark border">10 mins ago</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="list-group-item">
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
                                <div style="background: #e9ecef; width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
                                    <span class="fw-bold text-secondary">AA</span>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <h6 class="mb-0 fw-bold">Axl Andaya</h6>
                                    <small class="text-muted">Completed geometry assessment session</small>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <span class="badge bg-light text-dark border">1 hour ago</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="list-group-item">
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
                                <div style="background: #e9ecef; width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
                                    <span class="fw-bold text-secondary">EB</span>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <h6 class="mb-0 fw-bold">Ed Borromeo</h6>
                                    <small class="text-muted">Submitted weekly mathematics progress report</small>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <span class="badge bg-light text-dark border">3 hours ago</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Right Column: Quick Coordinator Actions -->
            <div class="col-md-5">
                <div class="gf-card border-top border-dark">
                    <h5><i class="fa-solid fa-gears me-2 text-dark"></i> Management Actions</h5>
                    <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.9rem;">As a Coordinator, you hold elevated privileges to oversee tutoring modules and adjust system evaluation parameters.</p>
                    
                    <div class="d-grid gap-3 mt-4">
                        <button class="btn btn-light border text-start p-3 hover-shadow transition">
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-pie text-primary fs-4"></i>
                                <div>
                                    <h6 class="mb-0 fw-bold">Generate System Reports</h6>
                                    <small class="text-muted">Export MATATAG performance data</small>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </button>
                        <button class="btn btn-light border text-start p-3 hover-shadow transition">
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-sliders text-success fs-4"></i>
                                <div>
                                    <h6 class="mb-0 fw-bold">Adjust Bayesian Logic</h6>
                                    <small class="text-muted">Fine-tune the competency tracking algorithms</small>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-top text-center">
                        <a href="/profile/security" class="text-decoration-none" style="color: #00aeef; font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.9rem;">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved me-1"></i> Review Account Security Status
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>